{"id": "Dewaf3Wyq49", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Katha 2, Part 2 of 2. Next katha: Ravana's secret.\nHow did Meghnad become Indrajit? 🔱\n\nInside the maya Mahadev gave him, Meghnad turns invisible. Arrows from nowhere, Indra's charioteer flees, and the king of the gods is dragged to Lanka in chains. Brahma comes, names the boy Indrajit, and asks him to free Indra.\n\nIndrajit asks for immortality. Brahma refuses: nothing on this earth is immortal. Instead: finish your yajna before battle and no one can kill you. Fight with it unfinished, and that is your end.\n\nYears later Lakshman breaks that yajna at Nikumbhila. The boon that made him unbeatable became the door to his death.\n\nAnd why did Indra lose? Gautam rishi's curse, for what he did to Ahalya.\n\nSources: Valmiki Ramayana, Uttara Kanda 7.29-30 · Yuddha Kanda 71, 72, 78\n\n#indrajit #ramayana #ravana #mahadev #dussehra", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792586162, "like_count": 855, "comment_count": 10, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2121096671840418a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.258, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPenq47h5K_jZobk9dR-z9ZE3ld3Xes2j6ViiF0un02nRWdvPzoxoO44najBEGIVPmGhVNyie9KUHPUW3JuI_PYsRkrsMQLjP20pEw.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adqn6aSJou8_Tau9K3oyXBSr5oJq64F-uJiTM50UdPlJh7EspFSuiiNvNkD6QGYUE8cEpGLYfNKLGji9NHtn_nUq&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Hn_POFtIVg0Q7kNvwF1CCJB&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=voZLqqYDVHmOeA2QjPgHEw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSzWTD3qpcRzx8OmwBaCvTZsmC8WkmfsqyaeR9p9iYZFg&oe=6AF44697", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 58.258, "resolutio